title BUHR Journey 5 opened — the web-read half beside the program-write half
prompt Autonomous loop: keep taking the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; approve own design rounds; double-seat visions from learned discoveries; send each increment; stop at custody gates.
think J4's editor is complete (open·commit·undo·fork·view). The named next crux — compose the web-read half beside the program-write half — is the last half of Realidream's one-graph promise; the card flagged it a checkpoint, the prompt says approve my own design rounds.
think Read the Realidream foundation to ground the design: it names the exact motion — two sources can feed one node, so separate inputs fuse into a single view. So the web-read half is a read *lane* fused beside the program-write *lane* on one append-only graph; one fold (mantra_browser.render) shows both.
think Seated the J5 exploration (self-approved design round; double-seats the vision for the named blind spot). Key discipline call: a real web fetch reaches a remote host — a genuine outward act — so it is held as a named seam behind a bounded reader, its own later rung that surfaces for Keaton's word. The first rung reads no network: read content supplied in-process, exactly as the demo catalog does.
think Built J5r1 realidream_reader.rye: pin_read appends read content under a read/ path (origin marked honestly), reusing editor.open_lane so a read lane is a lane like any other. Refuses non-read path (NotAReadPath) and duplicate (LaneExists via open_lane). First cut over-engineered the catalog type via a static; simplified to import mantra/recall_lap1 directly like the editor, using *mn.BoltCatalog.
think Witness proves: one render shows both origins grouped by bolt (local/web read + local/notes program); a program edit grows its lane while the read lane is byte-for-byte unchanged; refusals hold. J4 editor + J2 browser re-run GREEN (additive).
obs The fusion needs no new abstraction — Mantra's log already carries arbitrary content per lane, so a read is just a lane whose content came from a read. The path prefix carries the origin honestly so the graph can tell fetched from written.
obs Held the custody line cleanly: no socket opened; the network fetch is named, deferred, and gated to Keaton — matching REMEMBER's custody discipline while still making real progress on the design and its first agent-doable rung.
